{"verse_key": "25:10", "surah": 25, "verse": 10, "text_uthmani": "تَبَارَكَ ٱلَّذِىٓ إِن شَآءَ جَعَلَ لَكَ خَيْرًا مِّن ذَٰلِكَ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ وَيَجْعَل لَّكَ قُصُورًۢا", "translation": "Blessed is He who, if He willed, could have made for you [something] better than that - gardens beneath which rivers flow - and could make for you palaces.", "verse_from_ms": 163500, "verse_to_ms": 183590, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/25.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "تَبَارَكَ", "start_ms": 163500, "end_ms": 164640}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلَّذِىٓ", "start_ms": 164640, "end_ms": 165540}, {"i": 2, "text": "إِن", "start_ms": 165540, "end_ms": 168390}, {"i": 3, "text": "شَآءَ", "start_ms": 168390, "end_ms": 170750}, {"i": 4, "text": "جَعَلَ", "start_ms": 170750, "end_ms": 171370}, {"i": 5, "text": "لَكَ", "start_ms": 171370, "end_ms": 171730}, {"i": 6, "text": "خَيْرًا", "start_ms": 171730, "end_ms": 172460}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِّن", "start_ms": 172460, "end_ms": 173740}, {"i": 8, "text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "start_ms": 173740, "end_ms": 174540}, {"i": 9, "text": "جَنَّـٰتٍ", "start_ms": 174540, "end_ms": 176450}, {"i": 10, "text": "تَجْرِى", "start_ms": 176450, "end_ms": 177300}, {"i": 11, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 177300, "end_ms": 178080}, {"i": 12, "text": "تَحْتِهَا", "start_ms": 178080, "end_ms": 178850}, {"i": 13, "text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ", "start_ms": 178850, "end_ms": 180180}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَيَجْعَل", "start_ms": 180180, "end_ms": 181010}, {"i": 15, "text": "لَّكَ", "start_ms": 181010, "end_ms": 181600}, {"i": 16, "text": "قُصُورًۢا", "start_ms": 181600, "end_ms": 182825}]}